# Mark generated artifacts so GitHub diffs and `linguist` stats stay focused
# on hand-written sources (B4, mumei-lang/mumei#1449).
uv.lock linguist-generated
# Only JSON results are generated; reports/*.py runners and *.md memos are
# hand-authored and stay reviewable.
reports/**/*.json linguist-generated
forge_log.json linguist-generated
docs/_site/** linguist-generated

# Test fixtures under tests/ are hand-reviewed inputs, not generated output.
tests/** -linguist-generated
